This product includes hand-ported, edited copies of pieces of OpenCode's agent
loop, MCP client, storage service, and context-overflow pruning — not a
vendored copy of any OpenCode package. See vendor/opencode/README.md for
exactly which upstream file each of the following was derived from and what
was changed:

  - vendor/opencode/loop/run_turn.js       (agent loop + tool dispatch)
  - vendor/opencode/mcp/stdio.js           (stdio MCP client)
  - vendor/opencode/storage/storage.js     (session storage)
  - vendor/opencode/session/compaction.js  (context-overflow pruning)

TUI, desktop, IDE, and default shell/file tools are not included.

